      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Epidermal growth factor receptor tyrosine kinase inhibitors (EGFR-TKIs) have brought great clinical benefit to patients with EGFR-sensitive mutations. With the deepening of clinical and basic research, EGFR-TKIs have received more and more attention. In this review, we summarize the latest research development about EGFR-targeted drugs in 2016."},
